@startuml Place Bid
title Place Bid
actor Customer
participant Client
participant API
database Database

Customer -> Client: place bid (auction_id, item_id, amount)
Client -> API: POST /{auction_id}/bids
API -> Database: check registration, get item
Database --> API: registration, item
API -> Database: update current_bid, insert bid
Database --> API: bid id
API --> Client: BidResponse
Client --> Customer: bid accepted
@enduml
